  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "6B6041D212741466",
      "text": "Wie geht’s, wie steht’s? Ich heiße Jim und werde\\neuch in Biologie unterrichten.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "6B6040D2127412B3",
      "text": "In meinem Unterricht lernt ihr mehr über eure\\ngeliebten Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "6B603FD212741100",
      "text": "Ich hoffe, dass euch durch dieses Wissen\\neure Pokémon noch weiter ans Herz wachsen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "6B6046D212741CE5",
      "text": "Heute bringe ich euch deshalb bei, wie ihr eure\\nPokémon besser kennenlernen könnt![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "6B6045D212741B32",
      "text": "Wärt ihr gerne noch enger befreundet mit euren\\nPokémon?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "6B6044D21274197F",
      "text": "Dann solltet ihr sie aus ihrem Pokéball lassen\\nund mit ihnen spazieren gehen![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "6B6043D2127417CC",
      "text": "Ein Spruch für euer Merkheft:\\n„Drück die [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ZR-Taste[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], mein Kind,\\r\\nund wirf den Pokéball geschwind.“\\c\\nEs ist schon echt niedlich, wenn ein Pokémon\\neinem auf Schritt und Tritt nachläuft.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 193,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "6B604AD2127423B1",
      "text": "Sprecht ihr mit den Pokémon, die euch folgen,\\nreagieren sie auf euch. Vielleicht könnt ihr so\\r\\nauch etwas mehr über sie erfahren![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "6B6049D2127421FE",
      "text": "Aber Achtung! Es gibt Orte, an denen man mit\\nPokémon lieber nicht spazieren gehen sollte.\\r\\nWeiß jemand, wovon ich spreche?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "F08E3FAE26F1BE32",
      "text": "Am Wasser",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "F08E3EAE26F1BC7F",
      "text": "In Gebäuden",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "F08E3DAE26F1BACC",
      "text": "Im hohen Gras",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "49413B87A89B35A7",
      "text": "Manche Pokémon mögen kein Wasser, das ist\\nwahr. In dem Fall könnt ihr aber ein Boot nutzen,\\r\\nund schon ist das Problem gelöst![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_answer_02",
      "hash64": "49413C87A89B375A",
      "text": "Das ist korrekt! Du hast dich wohl gut auf den\\nUnterricht vorbereitet, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_answer_03",
      "hash64": "49413D87A89B390D",
      "text": "Im Gegenteil, Pokémon lieben hohes Gras! Dort\\nmachen ihnen Spaziergänge besonders viel Spaß.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "6B5D3CD21271D610",
      "text": "Die richtige Antwort ist: in Gebäuden![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "6B5D3DD21271D7C3",
      "text": "Lassen wir sie drinnen frei herumlaufen,\\nkönnen einige Pokémon zum Beispiel Wände\\r\\noder Möbel kaputtmachen.\\c\\nDeswegen ist es in Gebäuden allen Pokémon\\nverboten, ihre Pokébälle zu verlassen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 193,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "6B5D3ED21271D976",
      "text": "Lasst eure Pokémon also bitte nur draußen\\nfrei herumlaufen, okay?\\c\\nManchmal sehe ich sie nämlich hier im\\nKlassenzimmer...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "6B5D3FD21271DB29",
      "text": "Jedenfalls vertiefen gemeinsame Spaziergänge\\nauch die Freundschaft zu euren Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "6B5D40D21271DCDC",
      "text": "Oh, bevor ich’s vergesse! Denkt dran, dass ihr nur\\nmit dem Pokémon an der Spitze eures Teams\\r\\nspazieren gehen könnt![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "6B5D41D21271DE8F",
      "text": "Also, noch mal zur Erinnerung: Ihr müsst die\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ZR-Taste[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] drücken, um den Pokéball eines eurer\\r\\nPokémon zu werfen.\\c\\nUnd wenn ihr dabei auf ein wildes Pokémon\\nzielt, beginnt ein Kampf![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 191,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_01_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "6B5D42D21271E042",
      "text": "Das war’s auch schon für heute! Wir sehen uns\\nalle in der nächsten Unterrichtsstunde.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
